  "description": "Judo star Joo-Young and Taekwondo star Do-Yoon have been rivals and best friends since childhood. Now, they stand on the world’s biggest stage at the Olympic Games. After clinching her gold medal, Joo-Young decides it’s time to bury her long-held unrequited love for Do-Yoon once and for all. Using a childhood bet as her excuse, she asks him for a single night together to create one final memory. She expected a polite rejection or a simple favor, but Do-Yoon’s intense reaction suggests he has been waiting for this moment even longer than she has. \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note:\n\\- Part of Kingdom Company's Sarangi Kkotpineun Seonsuchon (사랑이 꽃피는 선수촌) Collection.*\n\\- includes three extra chapters.",
